{"seq":3,"slug":"electrophoresis-extraction","title":"电泳与萃取分离（Electrophoresis & Extraction）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/separation-techniques/electrophoresis-extraction","wordCount":3416,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"电泳与萃取分离-electrophoresis-extraction\">电泳与萃取分离（Electrophoresis &amp; Extraction）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电泳与萃取是两类目标相反的分离技术：<strong>电泳把混合物在空间上&quot;摊开&quot;</strong>（各组分因迁移率不同而在介质中分层），<strong>萃取把目标物从复杂基质中&quot;抓出来&quot;</strong>（利用相间分配把待测组分浓缩到另一相）。二者常串联使用——萃取负责净化富集，电泳（或色谱）负责最终分离。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    P[&quot;分离任务&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;电泳 按迁移率空间分离&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; X[&quot;萃取 按分配系数相间富集&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;凝胶电泳 按分子量/pI&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[&quot;毛细管电泳 高柱效 nL 级&quot;]&#10;    X --&gt; X1[&quot;相分配 LLE SPE SPME&quot;]&#10;    X --&gt; X2[&quot;现代微萃取 MSPE DLLME QuEChERS&quot;]&#10;    E1 --&gt; A[&quot;生物大分子分析&quot;]&#10;    E2 --&gt; A&#10;    X1 --&gt; B[&quot;色谱/质谱前处理&quot;]&#10;    X2 --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    P[\"分离任务\"] --&gt; E[\"电泳 按迁移率空间分离\"]\n    P --&gt; X[\"萃取 按分配系数相间富集\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"凝胶电泳 按分子量/pI\"]\n    E --&gt; E2[\"毛细管电泳 高柱效 nL 级\"]\n    X --&gt; X1[\"相分配 LLE SPE SPME\"]\n    X --&gt; X2[\"现代微萃取 MSPE DLLME QuEChERS\"]\n    E1 --&gt; A[\"生物大分子分析\"]\n    E2 --&gt; A\n    X1 --&gt; B[\"色谱/质谱前处理\"]\n    X2 --&gt; B</pre><p>理解这两类技术需要抓住以下要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>电泳的分离依据是迁移率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = q/(6\\pi\\eta r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：电荷越大、粒径越小，迁移越快。SDS-PAGE 通过让所有蛋白带上均匀电荷，把分离依据纯化为&quot;分子量&quot;；等电聚焦则把依据变成&quot;等电点 pI&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>电渗流（EOF）是毛细管电泳的独特推动力</strong>：管壁硅醇基解离带负电、吸引正离子形成双电层，电场驱动整体向阴极流动；中性分子虽不迁移，也被 EOF 一并推出，因此 CZE 能同时分析带电与中性组分。</li>\n<li><strong>萃取的本质是相间分配</strong>：分配系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越高、相比越小，单次萃取效率越高；多次小体积萃取优于单次大体积萃取（分配平衡的乘积效应）。</li>\n<li><strong>SPE 与 LLE 的定位差异</strong>：LLE 依仗溶剂分配，操作简单但溶剂用量大、易乳化；SPE 用固体吸附剂选择性富集，溶剂少、净化好、可自动化，是痕量分析前处理的主流。</li>\n<li><strong>常见误解</strong>：认为萃取只是&quot;除杂&quot;。实际上萃取同时承担<strong>净化</strong>（去基质）与<strong>富集</strong>（提高浓度）两重功能——正是这两个作用让 ng/L 级的环境污染物能被仪器检出（如 1 L 水样富集 2000 倍至 0.5 mL）。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡与反模式</strong>：SPME 无溶剂、可实现采样-萃取一体，但涂层容量有限、纤维批次间一致性差；QuEChERS 快而通用，却对强极性或强吸附性目标物回收率不足。方法选择应权衡回收率、基质效应、通量与环保要求，而非盲目追求&quot;最新&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"电泳分离技术概述\">电泳分离技术概述</h2><p>电泳（Electrophoresis）是利用带电粒子在电场作用下定向迁移速度的差异实现分离的技术。不同带电物质因其电荷量、分子大小和形状的不同，在同一电场中具有不同的迁移率（electrophoretic mobility），从而实现空间上的分离。电泳技术在生物化学、分子生物学和临床诊断中有着不可替代的地位，是蛋白质、核酸分析的标准工具。</p>\n<p>电泳迁移率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 的基本表达式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>E</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = \\frac{v}{E} = \\frac{q}{6\\pi\\eta r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 为迁移速度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 为电场强度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 为粒子有效电荷，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 为介质粘度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为粒子有效半径。该方程表明：电荷越大、粒径越小的粒子迁移速度越快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"凝胶电泳\">凝胶电泳</h2><h3 id=\"sds-page\">SDS-PAGE</h3><p>十二烷基硫酸钠-聚丙烯酰胺凝胶电泳（SDS-PAGE）是蛋白质分子量测定的经典方法。SDS 是一种阴离子表面活性剂，以约 1.4 g SDS/g 蛋白质的恒定比例与蛋白质结合，使所有蛋白质带上均匀的负电荷。此时蛋白质的电泳迁移率仅取决于其分子量——小分子蛋白能穿过凝胶网孔更快到达阳极，大分子蛋白则被减速。</p>\n<p>凝胶浓度决定分辨范围：7.5% 凝胶适合 40-200 kDa 蛋白质，12% 凝胶适合 15-100 kDa，15% 凝胶适合 10-50 kDa。梯度凝胶（4-20%）可在一块胶上同时分辨宽分子量范围的蛋白质。</p>\n<p>分子量与迁移距离的关系为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log M_r = a - b \\cdot R_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为相对分子质量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为相对迁移率（组分迁移距离/前沿迁移距离），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为常数，由标准蛋白标记物标定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"琼脂糖凝胶电泳\">琼脂糖凝胶电泳</h3><p>琼脂糖凝胶电泳主要用于核酸（DNA、RNA）的分离和分析。琼脂糖浓度 0.5-2% 对应不同的有效分离范围：0.5% 凝胶分辨 1-30 kb 的 DNA 片段，2% 凝胶分辨 0.1-2 kb 片段。核酸在中性 pH 条件下带负电荷（磷酸骨架），在电场中向阳极迁移，迁移速度与片段长度的对数成反比。</p>\n<p>溴化乙啶（EtBr）或 SYBR Green 等荧光染料可嵌入 DNA 双螺旋中，在紫外灯或蓝光激发下发出荧光，实现核酸条带的可视化检测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二维电泳-2-de\">二维电泳（2-DE）</h3><p>二维电泳将等电聚焦（IEF，第一维，按等电点 pI 分离）与 SDS-PAGE（第二维，按分子量分离）正交组合，可在单张凝胶上分辨数千种蛋白质。2-DE 是蛋白质组学早期的核心技术，虽然近年来逐渐被基于质谱的无凝胶方法取代，但在差异蛋白质组学和翻译后修饰研究中仍有应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"毛细管电泳\">毛细管电泳</h2><p>毛细管电泳（Capillary Electrophoresis, CE）将电泳微型化到内径 25-100 μm 的石英毛细管中进行，具有分离效率极高（理论塔板数可达 10⁵-10⁶）、样品用量极少（nL 级）、分析速度快的优点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"毛细管区带电泳-cze\">毛细管区带电泳（CZE）</h3><p>CZE 是最基本的 CE 模式。样品在缓冲液填充的毛细管两端施加高压（10-30 kV），各组分按电泳迁移率差异在自由溶液中分离。电渗流（Electroosmotic Flow, EOF）为整体推动力，将所有组分（包括中性分子）从阳极端推向阴极端的检测窗口。</p>\n<p>EOF 的线速度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mi>ζ</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mi>η</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{EOF} = \\frac{\\varepsilon \\zeta E}{\\eta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">εζ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 为介质介电常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span></span></span></span></span> 为管壁的 Zeta 电位，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 为电场强度。硅胶管壁的硅醇基在 pH &gt; 3 时解离带负电，形成正电荷扩散双电层，在电场作用下向阴极方向流动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"毛细管胶束电动色谱-mekc\">毛细管胶束电动色谱（MEKC）</h3><p>MEKC 在缓冲液中加入胶束（如十二烷基硫酸钠，SDS 浓度 &gt; CMC），形成拟固定相。中性分子可根据其在胶束/水相之间分配系数的不同而被分离，将 CE 的应用范围从带电分子扩展到中性小分子。</p>\n<h3 id=\"毛细管等电聚焦-cief\">毛细管等电聚焦（cIEF）</h3><p>cIEF 利用两性电解质在毛细管中建立 pH 梯度，蛋白质迁移至其等电点位置后聚焦成窄带。cIEF 是单克隆抗体电荷异质性分析的首选方法，可分辨 ΔpI = 0.01 的电荷变体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"萃取分离技术\">萃取分离技术</h2><p>萃取（Extraction）是利用待测组分在两个不相溶相之间的分配差异将其从样品基质中选择性富集到分析相的过程。萃取是色谱和光谱分析之前最重要的样品前处理步骤。</p>\n<p>下表对比主要萃取技术的原理、溶剂用量与典型定位，是前处理方法选型的核心对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>萃取技术</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>溶剂/材料用量</th>\n<th>富集倍数</th>\n<th>典型定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>液-液萃取（LLE）</td>\n<td>相间分配</td>\n<td>数十 mL 有机溶剂</td>\n<td>视相比而定</td>\n<td>经典、适合脂溶性目标物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固相萃取（SPE）</td>\n<td>固体吸附剂选择性保留</td>\n<td>mL 级溶剂</td>\n<td>100-1000 倍</td>\n<td>痕量分析主流前处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固相微萃取（SPME）</td>\n<td>涂层吸附/吸收</td>\n<td>无溶剂</td>\n<td>视分配系数而定</td>\n<td>采样-萃取一体、GC 联用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QuEChERS</td>\n<td>盐析分层 + d-SPE 净化</td>\n<td>乙腈 + 少量吸附剂</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>食品农药多残留高通量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超临界流体萃取（SFE）</td>\n<td>超临界 CO₂ 溶解</td>\n<td>CO₂，无有机溶剂残留</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>天然产物脂溶性成分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁性固相萃取（MSPE）</td>\n<td>磁性纳米粒子吸附 + 磁分离</td>\n<td>微量</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大体积水样痕量富集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分散液-液微萃取（DLLME）</td>\n<td>乳化微滴快速分配</td>\n<td>μL 级</td>\n<td>100-1000 倍</td>\n<td>快速、极低溶剂消耗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"液-液萃取-lle\">液-液萃取（LLE）</h3><p>液-液萃取是最经典的萃取方法。将水相样品与不相溶的有机溶剂（如二氯甲烷、乙酸乙酯、正己烷）振荡混合，目标分析物根据其在两相中的分配系数转移到有机相中。萃取效率由分配系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和相比决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\frac{K_D}{K_D + V_w/V_o} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>多次小体积萃取的效率高于单次大体积萃取。对于酸碱性物质，调节 pH 可改变其电离状态从而控制分配系数（离子态不易进入有机相）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"固相萃取-spe\">固相萃取（SPE）</h3><p>固相萃取使用填装有选择性吸附材料的小柱（cartridge），通过&quot;活化-上样-淋洗-洗脱&quot;四步操作实现目标物的净化和浓缩。常用填料包括 C₁₈（反相）、硅胶（正相）、SCX/SAX（离子交换）、聚合物基质（如 Oasis HLB）等。</p>\n<p>SPE 的主要优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>溶剂用量少（mL 级），环境友好</li>\n<li>可自动化（96 孔板式 SPE）</li>\n<li>净化效果好，有效去除基质干扰</li>\n<li>富集倍数高（可达 100-1000 倍）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"固相微萃取-spme\">固相微萃取（SPME）</h3><p>固相微萃取由 Janusz Pawliszyn 于 1990 年发明，使用涂覆固定相涂层的石英纤维作为萃取介质。纤维暴露于样品或样品顶空后，分析物通过吸附/吸收富集在涂层中，然后直接插入 GC 进样口热解吸。SPME 实现了采样、萃取、浓缩的一步操作，无需有机溶剂。</p>\n<p>SPME 的萃取量由以下平衡关系决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\frac{K_{fs} V_f C_0 V_s}{K_{fs} V_f + V_s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span st